Backup of Tokyo Mizo Church Finance, <%= @backup.created_on.strftime("%-d %B %Y") %>.

The attached file is the whole database, encrypted with the backup
passphrase (BACKUP_PASSPHRASE on Railway). Keep this email; nothing in it
can be read without the passphrase.

To open it on a computer:

  openssl enc -d -aes-256-cbc -pbkdf2 -iter <%= DatabaseBackup::ITERATIONS %> -md sha256 \
    -in <%= @backup.filename %> -out backup.sqlite3.gz
  gunzip backup.sqlite3.gz

backup.sqlite3 can then replace production.sqlite3 on the Railway volume.
